 ◆ self-host                                                              v1.0.0

  Easy names at home

  ╭───────────────╮      ╭────────╮      ╭────────────────────────────────╮
  │ phones        │──────│ router │──────│ Caddy                          │
  │ TVs · laptops │      ╰───┬────╯      │ jellyfin.192-168-1-20.sslip.io │
  ╰───────────────╯      internet ✗      ╰────────────────────────────────╯

  Open each App by name instead of a port number. Caddy answers the names on
  your home network. The addresses with numbers keep working if a name
  doesn't.

  Which names?
  Each App with a web page gets a name like jellyfin.192-168-1-20.sslip.io.
  Names are checked from this computer, not your phone or TV; their name
  lookup may differ. No .local names are announced.

  When names don't work
  The names need internet name lookup. Some routers hide them, and a phone

